#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx2.md:7
msgid ""
"This all-in-one DJ controller features a built in 4 channel sound card with "
"balanced XLR main outputs and a balanced microphone input. It is a USB class"
" compliant MIDI and audio device (unlike older Hercules controllers)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx2.md:12
msgid "User Options"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx2.md:14
msgid ""
"To change the mapping’s user options, you have to open the script file "
"(\\*.js). At the top of the file under `USER OPTIONS` the following settings"
" can be made:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx2.md:16
msgid ""
"**DJCRMX2.jogwheelSensivity**: Sets the jogwheel sensitivity. 1 = default, 2"
" is twice as sensitive, 0.5 is half as sensitive."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx2.md:17
msgid ""
"**DJCRMX2.jogwheelShiftMultiplier**: Sets how much more sensitive the "
"jogwheels get when holding [**SHIFT**]. Set it to 1 to disable jogwheel "
"sensitivity increase when holding [**SHIFT**]."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx2.md:18
msgid ""
"**DJCRMX2.twinkleVumeterAutodjOn**: If true, level-meter twinkles if "
"*AutoDJ* is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx2.md:19
msgid ""
"**DJCRMX2.autoPFL**: If true, PFL / Cue (headphone) is being activated by "
"loading a track into certain deck."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx2.md:20
msgid ""
"**DJCRMX2.vuMeterOutputMaster**: If true, deck vu meters show main output (L"
" = Deck A, R = Deck B). If false, deck vu meter shows deck output (mono)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/hercules_dj_console_rmx2.md:21
msgid ""
"**DJCRMX2.showHideSamplersEffectsOnPadMode**: If true, *Samplers* and "
"*EffectRack* get shown or hidden depending on the Pad-Mode."
msgstr ""

